      "en": "Now in the thirtieth year, in the fourth month, in the fifth day of the month, as I was among the captives by the river Chebar, the heavens were opened, and I saw visions of God.",
      "ko": "제 삼십년 사월 오일에 내가 그발강 가 사로잡힌 자 중에 있더니 하늘이 열리며 하나님의 이상을 내게 보이시니",
      "source_text_hash": "62cf7c248a24a4b4efc8c3a0c03e715044db1fa33bed8ce8b71d677d72026078",
      "translation_text_hash": "1ece34710bdae3b1af048525b00ccb28750b0a3a2bad2503d9a0f09d0b7c45a3",
