      "en": "Everyone had four faces, and each one of them had four wings.",
      "ko": "각각 네 얼굴과 네 날개가 있고",
      "source_text_hash": "6b3bf651cb0b35b43877643431939b3a5cf08d9f8d2c09504720c20e86435def",
      "translation_text_hash": "8a8a924373b366e7151b448788e4404012e34d3d05058a3de20016cb5b68d2d2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
