      "en": "Their feet were straight feet. The sole of their feet was like the sole of a calf’s foot; and they sparkled like burnished bronze.",
      "ko": "그 다리는 곧고 그 발바닥은 송아지 발바닥 같고 마광한 구리 같이 빛나며",
      "source_text_hash": "9e0b133b2dadc7204fa01dd97d868b2fe8b3bc112ed0bedaff2ff6e911b8c6f7",
      "translation_text_hash": "f309b0547e79d198e8b5ede7f8e0ba15047b64cc01ffc1790bd3515be242dc6d",
