      "en": "They had the hands of a man under their wings on their four sides. The four of them had their faces and their wings like this:",
      "ko": "그 사면 날개 밑에는 각각 사람의 손이 있더라 그 네 생물의 얼굴과 날개가 이러하니",
      "source_text_hash": "02da99e45e408703f2cb1c6cfba15facf0665e2033afda6329b4c0aaa2b544cf",
      "translation_text_hash": "a4821480b500a03b3deb7862d2c418f8fe7e569beadd743cc571c64a90777698",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
