      "en": "The living creatures ran and returned as the appearance of a flash of lightning.",
      "ko": "그 생물의 왕래가 번개 같이 빠르더라",
      "source_text_hash": "068a921283bf3d7855a9dafc9d0a5ad9e06d110b37f637fb7abb0e5002de324a",
