      "en": "Wherever the spirit was to go, they went. The spirit was to go there. The wheels were lifted up beside them; for the spirit of the living creature was in the wheels.",
      "ko": "어디든지 신이 가려하면 생물도 신의 가려하는 곳으로 가고 바퀴도 그 곁에서 들리니 이는 생물의 신이 그 바퀴 가운데 있음이라",
      "source_text_hash": "3033975fb00292cad8cf3f6db6370842a5389062c3148e53b948b1fb0026e9f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "e790356b55445f9ff12b2553ca94eaba5e654811dc2fd4f9eb470078bfbc7c13",
